        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Carr, Joyce Wieland\n- Works: The Cherokee Flash\n- Roles: film director, actor, experimental filmmaker, mixed media artist\n- Topics: Hollywood movies, television programs, American Western films\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Carr was born on July 4, 1907, and he was an American actor and film director of Hollywood movies and television programs.\n- Joyce Wieland was born on June 30, 1930, and she was a Canadian experimental filmmaker and mixed media artist.\n- The Cherokee Flash is a 1945 American Western directed by Thomas Carr.\n- Thomas Carr died on April 23, 1997.\n- Joyce Wieland died on June 27, 1998.",
